00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:11.660
Bring him in here!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.060
Miss Gaskell, get that fire lit, quick.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.540
Miss Jones, bring in whatever blankets we have.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.940
Mr. Pearson, see what we've got in terms of food.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.820
Davy's dead.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.360
There was nothing more you could have done.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.880
What are we gonna do? We need supplies.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.800
Well, first of all, you're gonna stay here, and you are gonna get yourself worn.

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.420
Now, I sent John and Mike a scout now to head.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.420
Arthur and I, we're gonna ride out, see if we can find one of them.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.360
And this, just for a short bit.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.580
And I don't see what other choice we have.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.180
Listen.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:15.360
Listen to me, all of you, for a moment.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:20.540
Now, we've had, well, a bad couple of days.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.840
I loved Davy.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:25.880
I loved you.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:28.440
Jenny.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.500
I loved you.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.040
Sean, Mac, they may be okay.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.660
We don't know.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.260
But we lost some folks.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:48.800
Now, if I could throw myself in the ground in their stead, I'd do it.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:49.820
Gladly.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:57.360
But we're gonna ride out, and we're gonna find some food.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:57.420
Everybody.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.560
Everybody.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.880
We're safe now.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:06.960
There ain't nobody following us through a storm like this one.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:12.380
And by the time they get here, well, we're gonna be, we're gonna be long gone.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.140
We've been through worse than this before.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.320
Mr. Pearson.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:19.960
Miss Grimshaw.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:23.080
I need you to turn this place into a camp.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.560
We may be here for a few days.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.160
Now, all of you.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.580
All of you.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.920
Get yourselves warm.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.020
Stay strong.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.060
Stay with me.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.360
We ain't done yet.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.740
Come on, Arthur.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:46.640
All right.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.100
We've got some work to do.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.720
Well, we ain't run into them yet.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.600
So, they both must have headed down the hill.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:54.180
Sure.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.040
Well, hey.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.860
I ain't had time to ask.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.920
What really went down back there on that boat?

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:04.580
We missed you.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.080
That's what happened.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:06.800
Come on.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:08.660
Oh.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.280
Hey.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.560
You need horses?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:12.240
Oh, yeah.

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:13.460
Hey, Mr. Smith.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:14.960
Get yourself indoors.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.220
You need to rest that hand.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:17.880
I'll live.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.640
Get indoors, son.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:20.580
Bye.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.920
We need you strong.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:25.460
Okay.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:25.540
Bye.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.140
Bye.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.900
Bye.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:35.640
And I need you to get me an về.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:36.660
You guys probably...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:58.840
a´ot councilor Mortensen

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.080
Or something.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.440
to stick to the trail.

